<title>JAPAN: SUMITOMO ELEC FILES Y100 BLN SHELF REGISTRATION.</title>
<headline>SUMITOMO ELEC FILES Y100 BLN SHELF REGISTRATION.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Electric Industries Ltd said on Monday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 100 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective for two years from August 16.</p>
</text>
